<h3 id="37-edmonds-karp-复杂度">3.7 Edmonds-Karp 复杂度<a class="heading-anchor" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1" href="#37-edmonds-karp-复杂度">#</a></h3>
<p><strong>定理 3.7（Edmonds-Karp 复杂度）</strong> Edmonds-Karp 算法（每次以 BFS 选最短增广路径）的复杂度为：</p>
<p><span class="katex-error" title="ParseError: KaTeX parse error: \tag works only in display equations" style="color:#cc0000">O(V E^2) \tag{3.4}</span></p>
<p><strong>证明概要</strong>（详见 CLRS 4th 第 26.2 节）：</p>
<ol>
