<h3 id="38-dinic-复杂度">3.8 Dinic 复杂度<a class="heading-anchor" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1" href="#38-dinic-复杂度">#</a></h3>
<p><strong>定理 3.8（Dinic 复杂度）</strong> Dinic 算法的复杂度为：</p>
<p><span class="katex-error" title="ParseError: KaTeX parse error: \tag works only in display equations" style="color:#cc0000">O(V^2 E) \tag{3.5}</span></p>
